{"step_index":1663,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T23:30:44Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-25T18:30:44-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:30:47-05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-25T18:30:44-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:30:47-05:00\nShowing lines 1-120 of 443\n1: # Grand Theft Auto VI: Campaign Mission Flow & Prerequisite Guide\n2: \n3: This document provides the definitive mission dependency graph, prerequisite unlock trees, character-switching milestones, heist setup pipelines, points of no return, and speedrun routing across all 5 story chapters of *Grand Theft Auto VI* based on verified data from **Build 1.0.2.1**.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 1. High-Level Campaign Architecture\n8: \n9: The GTA VI storyline progresses through five distinct geographical and thematic narrative blocks. While open-world exploration is available between operations, missions operate in a strict Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) with key narrative bottlenecks connecting each chapter.\n10: \n11: ```mermaid\n12: flowchart TD\n13:     subgraph C1B[\"Prologue & Chapter 1\"]\n14:         C1[\"Just Like Paradise<br/>(Leonida Keys & Key Lento)<br/>Missions 1 - 21\"]\n15:     end\n16: \n17:     subgraph C2B[\"Chapter 2\"]\n18:         C2[\"Paradise Lost<br/>(Port Gellhorn & Kelly County)<br/>Missions 23 - 44\"]\n19:     end\n20: \n21:     subgraph C3B[\"Chapter 3\"]\n22:         C3[\"Vice City Syndicate Expansion<br/>(Vice City Metro & Sinfrontera Heist)<br/>Missions 45 - 70\"]\n23:     end\n24: \n25:     subgraph C4B[\"Chapter 4\"]\n26:         C4[\"Vice City Metro & Airport Takedown<br/>(Ocean Beach & VCIA Cargo Heist)<br/>Missions 71 - 95\"]\n27:     end\n28: \n29:     subgraph C5B[\"Chapter 5\"]\n30:         C5[\"Top of the World, Ma!<br/>(Climax, Standoff & Branching Endings)<br/>Missions 96 - 102\"]\n31:     end\n32: \n33:     C1 -->|\"Bottleneck: Discharge Time [BIL_WHEEL]\"| C2\n34:     C2 -->|\"Bottleneck: Checking Out [BIL_MOTEL]\"| C3\n35:     C3 -->|\"Bottleneck: The Cartel Heist [ROB_BANK]\"| C4\n36:     C4 -->|\"Point of No Return: Sunset [ROB_AIR_END]\"| C5\n37: ```\n38: \n39: ---\n40: \n41: ## 2. Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise (Leonida Keys)\n42: \n43: ### Mechanics & Structure\n44: - **Playable Character**: Strictly locked to **Jason** for early operations, introducing **Lucia** in the Prologue, reuniting in *\"Coming Home\"*, featuring a solo mission for Lucia in *\"Home Sweet Home\"*, and concluding with the joint hospital escape in *\"Discharge Time\"*.\n45: - **Total Missions**: **21 main and side-strand missions** (`replay_menu_position` 0–21 / `story_list_order` 0–22 in `mission_order.json`).\n46: - **Core Narrative**: Petty smuggling, local debt enforcement for Brian, and settling in Key Lento following Lucia's release from Hamlet State Penitentiary, culminating in a violent clash with the Kingfishers, Donnie's death, a botched bag pickup at Grassrivers Visitor Center, the burning of their Hamlet house, and a desperate shootout escape from Vice City Hospital.\n47: - **Parallel Multi-Branch Architecture**: After completing *\"Gone Fishing\"* ($140 mailbox cash pickup), the storyline opens concurrent tracks:\n48:   1. **Branch 1 (Cal & Brian Marina Jobs)**: *Unwanted Attention* (`COM_KBOS_COLAT` - $200 mailbox cash pickup) $\\rightarrow$ *Pipework* (`COM_KBOS_NEIGHB`). *(Both verified Any% skips auto-flagged by `func_10AA55`)*.\n49:   2. **Branch 2A (Vehicle Repair Gate)**: *Just a Scratch* (`FT_KMODSHP` - Ganado repair & respray; **Mandatory Story Gate**; Joey's unlock text `0x2A09A6FD` specifies `\"Complete Gone Fishing to unlock.\"`).\n50:   3. **Branch 2B (Brian Armory)**: *Gear Up* (`FT_AMUCO` - Longarm pickup; parallel side branch off *Gone Fishing* with **no verified script link** gating Joey's text or *Just a Scratch*).\n51:   4. **Branch 3 (Rent Collection & Main Spine)**: *Lab Fees* (`COM_KBOS_SHOP` - Any% skip) $\\rightarrow$ *Hey Arnold!* (`COM_KBOS_RADR` - 08:00–16:00 window, Any% skip) $\\rightarrow$ *Feng Shui* (`COM_SFH_MVFN` - triggers mandatory 24h wait) $\\rightarrow$ *Coming Home* (`INT_PRISO` - Lucia released from prison) $\\rightarrow$ *Find Donnie's Package* (`CTI_PIL_RD_SH`).\n52: - **Sub-Branch: Island Dreams (`CSC_TRH_CHART`)**: Unlocked via Kenton's call during *Hey Arnold!*. Optional shipwreck treasure diving side mission (**Any% Skip**).\n53: - **Decision Diamond 1 (Gate Check)**: Evaluates whether the player has completed *Just a Scratch*. If not completed, Joey places an urgent reminder call redirecting Jason back to clear the repair shop gate before *Buck Me* unlocks.\n54: - **Decision Diamond 2 (Smuggler Gate Check)**: Evaluates whether BOTH *Day Release* (`BIL_FUN` - 07:00–17:00 window) AND *Just a Scratch* (`FT_KMODSHP`) are completed before Brian's call triggers *Swamped*.\n55: - **The Chapter 1 Climax Gauntlet (M16–M21)**:\n56:   - **16. Swamped (`INT_AIR`)**: Jason, Brian, and Lori confront the Kingfishers. Donnie is killed, Lori is taken hostage and rescued in the Grassrivers, and Brian retires from smuggling.\n57:   - **Side Branch off Donnie's Death (Any% Skips)**:\n58:     - **17. Don Gone (`COM_KBOS_CLEAN`)**: Brian asks Jason to clean out Donnie's trailer. Exact `0DRP` title is **`Don Gone`**, not \"Doin' Gone\". *(Auto-flagged by `func_10AA55`)*.\n59:     - **18. Recalibration (`HO_PAR_KEYCO`)**: Jason and Lucia take a grieving Cal fishing after Donnie's death. *(Auto-flagged by `func_10AA55`)*.\n60:   - **Main Story Climax Sequence (Mandatory)**:\n61:     - **19. Tourist Trap (`BIL_PICK`)**: Disguised pickup from a locker at Grassrivers Visitor Center. Has day (`BIL_PICK_DAY_TIME_START` 10:00–17:00) and night (`BIL_PICK_NIGHT_TIME_START` 17:00–10:00) triggers. Ambushed by dirty cops; Jason is critically shot! Cal rushes Jason to Vice City Hospital.\n62:     - **20. Home Sweet Home (`BIL_HOUSE`)**: Lucia returns solo to their Hamlet home to retrieve Jason's stash. Ambushed by masked cartel hitmen; Lucia escapes but their home is burned to the ground.\n63:     - **21. Discharge Time (`BIL_WHEEL`)**: **★ TRUE CHAPTER 1 CLIMAX FINALE ★**. Lucia infiltrates Vice City Hospital to save Jason. They fight through dirty cops and cartel gunmen, hijack an ambulance, and flee west across the county line into Port Gellhorn.\n64: - **Transition to Chapter 2 (`MTL_WAKE`)**: Hard cut to Starlet Motel. When `MTL_WAKE` starts, script handler `func_10AA55` sweeps the flag store and automatically marks all uncompleted Chapter 1 side missions as completed.\n65: \n66: ### The 7 Verified Any% Skippable Missions (Auto-Flagged by `func_10AA55`)\n67: In `0xD2601E252151E04B.ysc.cs:572964-572999`, when `MTL_WAKE` (0x3C9B93B4) is flagged, the game automatically sets completion flags for all 7 uncompleted side operations:\n68: 1. **Lab Fees** (`COM_KBOS_SHOP`, Hash `0x2D7D2164`)\n69: 2. **Unwanted Attention** (`COM_KBOS_COLAT`, Hash `0x5AE70594`)\n70: 3. **Pipework** (`COM_KBOS_NEIGHB`, Hash `0xC8513199`)\n71: 4. **Hey Arnold!** (`COM_KBOS_RADR`, Hash `0x21D03E4F`)\n72: 5. **Don Gone** (`COM_KBOS_CLEAN`, Hash `0x10BE4C94`)\n73: 6. **Recalibration** (`HO_PAR_KEYCO`, Hash `0x420623AF`)\n74: 7. **Island Dreams** (`CSC_TRH_CHART`, Hash `0x617A1865` — Optional standalone side activity)\n75: \n76: ```mermaid\n77: flowchart TD\n78:     M01[\"1. Prologue<br/><code>INT_PROLO</code> • Lucia Counselor Interview\"] --> M02[\"2. Gone Fishing<br/><code>INT_CHASE</code> • Boat Drop - $140 Mailbox\"]\n79:     \n80:     %% Split Bar into 3 Tracks\n81:     M02 --> B1_Split[\"3-Track Branch Split\"]\n82:     \n83:     subgraph Track1[\"Branch 1: Cal & Marina Odd Jobs (Any% Skip)\"]\n84:         M03[\"3. Unwanted Attention<br/><code>COM_KBOS_COLAT</code> • Cal Hamlet Trip<br/>[$200 Mailbox | ANY% SKIP]\"] --> M04[\"4. Pipework<br/><code>COM_KBOS_NEIGHB</code> • Mandy Maintenance<br/>[ANY% SKIP / AUTO-FLAGGED]\"]\n85:     end\n86:     \n87:     subgraph Track2[\"Branch 2: Brian Armory & Gate (Mandatory)\"]\n88:         M05[\"5. Gear Up<br/><code>FT_AMUCO</code> • Longarm Pickup\"] --> M06[\"6. Just a Scratch<br/><code>FT_KMODSHP</code> • Ganado Respray<br/>★ MANDATORY STORY GATE ★\"]\n89:     end\n90:     \n91:     subgraph Track3[\"Branch 3: Main Narrative Spine\"]\n92:         M07[\"7. Lab Fees<br/><code>COM_KBOS_SHOP</code> • Rent Collection<br/>[ANY% SKIP / AUTO-FLAGGED]\"] --> M08[\"8. Hey Arnold!<br/><code>COM_KBOS_RADR</code> • Cargo Broker<br/>[08:00–16:00 | ANY% SKIP]\"]\n93:         M08 -.-> M09[\"Island Dreams<br/><code>CSC_TRH_CHART</code> • Keys Diving<br/>[ANY% SKIP / OPTIONAL]\"]\n94:         M08 --> M10[\"9. Feng Shui<br/><code>COM_SFH_MVFN</code> • Move Furniture<br/>(24h Cooldown Trigger)\"]\n95:         M10 --> M11[\"10. Coming Home<br/><code>INT_PRISO</code> • Lucia Released<br/>★ DUO REUNITED ★\"]\n96:         M11 --> M12[\"11. Find Donnie's Package<br/><code>CTI_PIL_RD_SH</code> • Hamlet Drug Retrieval\"]\n97:     end\n98:     \n99:     B1_Split --> M03\n100:     B1_Split --> M05\n101:     B1_Split --> M07\n102:     \n103:     %% Decision Diamond 1\n104:     M12 --> DIA1{\"Did player finish<br/>JUST A SCRATCH?\"}\n105:     DIA1 -->|\"NO\"| JOEY[\"Joey Reminder Call<br/>(Redirects to Just a Scratch)\"]\n106:     JOEY -.-> M06\n107:     M06 -.-> DIA1\n108:     \n109:     DIA1 -->|\"YES\"| M13[\"12. Buck Me<br/><code>INT_BANK</code> • Banking App Setup & Deposit\"]\n110:     M13 --> M14[\"13. Down to Earth<br/><code>COM_KBOS_PLNDATE</code> • Seaplane Smuggling<br/>($600 Mailbox)\"]\n111:     M14 --> M15[\"14. Clear Skies<br/><code>INT_PLNSH</code> • Southwind Bikers<br/>[07:00–23:00 Window]\"]\n112:     M15 --> M16[\"15. Day Release<br/><code>BIL_FUN</code> • Rusty Anchor & Club NINE1NINE<br/>[07:00–17:00 Window]\"]\n113:     \n114:     %% Decision Diamond 2\n115:     M16 --> DIA2{\"Are DAY RELEASE &<br/>JUST A SCRATCH both done?\"}\n116:     M06 ==>|\"Mandatory Check\"| DIA2\n117:     \n118:     DIA2 -->|\"YES\"| M17[\"16. Swamped<br/><code>INT_AIR</code> • Kingfishers Smugglers Meet<br/>Donnie Killed | Lori Rescued\"]\n119:     \n120:     %% Split off Swamped: Optional side cleanup vs. Mandatory Climax"}
{"step_index":1664,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T23:30:46Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-25T18:30:46-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:30:47-05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-25T18:30:46-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:30:47-05:00\nShowing lines 1-100 of 1094\n1: import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n2: import matplotlib.patches as patches\n3: import os\n4: import shutil\n5: \n6: # Directories\n7: WORKSPACE_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\"\n8: DOWNLOADS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\"\n9: ANTIGRAV_DL_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\antigravity_version\"\n10: ANTIGRAV_WS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\output\\antigravity_version\"\n11: WORKFLOW_CHARTS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\gta 6 mission workflow charts\"\n12: ARTIFACT_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\.gemini\\antigravity-cli\\brain\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\"\n13: \n14: # Classic Ground-Truth Theme Colors (Matching image_1188e9.jpg & GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.jpg)\n15: BG_COLOR = \"#33363b\"          # Slate-gray background\n16: CARD_BG_NORMAL = \"#fef08a\"    # Warm cream / yellow\n17: CARD_BORDER_NORMAL = \"#ca8a04\"# Golden yellow border\n18: CARD_BG_CLIMAX = \"#ffedd5\"    # Warm peach / orange\n19: CARD_BORDER_CLIMAX = \"#ea580c\"# Deep orange border\n20: CARD_BG_SKIP = \"#f3e8ff\"      # Light purple for skippable side missions\n21: CARD_BORDER_SKIP = \"#a855f7\"  # Purple border\n22: TEXT_COLOR = \"#1c1917\"        # Dark charcoal / black text\n23: SUBTEXT_COLOR = \"#44403c\"     # Muted charcoal subtext\n24: \n25: def draw_mission(ax, x, y, w, h, title, subtitle=\"\", is_climax=False, is_gate=False, is_skip=False, font_size=8.2):\n26:     if is_climax:\n27:         bg = CARD_BG_CLIMAX\n28:         border = CARD_BORDER_CLIMAX\n29:     elif is_skip:\n30:         bg = CARD_BG_SKIP\n31:         border = CARD_BORDER_SKIP\n32:     else:\n33:         bg = CARD_BG_NORMAL\n34:         border = CARD_BORDER_NORMAL\n35:         \n36:     lw = 2.0 if (is_climax or is_gate) else 1.2\n37:     \n38:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n39:         (x, y), w, h,\n40:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.10\",\n41:         linewidth=lw,\n42:         edgecolor=border,\n43:         facecolor=bg,\n44:         zorder=3\n45:     )\n46:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n47:     \n48:     ty = y + h/2 + 0.14 if subtitle else y + h/2\n49:     c_title = \"#581c87\" if is_skip else TEXT_COLOR\n50:     c_sub = \"#6b21a8\" if is_skip else SUBTEXT_COLOR\n51:     \n52:     ax.text(x + w/2, ty, title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=c_title, zorder=4)\n53:     if subtitle:\n54:         ax.text(x + w/2, y + 0.22, subtitle, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size-1.8, color=c_sub, zorder=4)\n55: \n56: def draw_callout(ax, x, y, w, h, text, icon_type=\"text\", font_size=7.0):\n57:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n58:         (x, y), w, h,\n59:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n60:         linewidth=1.0,\n61:         edgecolor=\"#71717a\",\n62:         facecolor=\"#ffffff\",\n63:         zorder=3\n64:     )\n65:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n66:     \n67:     prefix = \"\"\n68:     if icon_type == \"phone\":\n69:         prefix = \"[CALL] \"\n70:     elif icon_type == \"text\":\n71:         prefix = \"[MSG] \"\n72:     elif icon_type == \"mailbox\":\n73:         prefix = \"[MAILBOX] \"\n74:     elif icon_type == \"cash\":\n75:         prefix = \"[$] \"\n76:         \n77:     ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, prefix + text, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\" if icon_type in [\"phone\", \"cash\"] else \"normal\", color=\"#09090b\", zorder=4)\n78: \n79: def draw_heart(ax, x, y, w, h, text, skip_label=\"[ANY% SKIP]\", font_size=7.0):\n80:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n81:         (x, y), w, h,\n82:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n83:         linewidth=1.2,\n84:         edgecolor=\"#f43f5e\",\n85:         facecolor=\"#ffe4e6\",\n86:         zorder=3\n87:     )\n88:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n89:     t = \"♥ \" + text\n90:     if skip_label:\n91:         t += \"\\n\" + skip_label\n92:     ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, t, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#9f1239\", zorder=4)\n93: \n94: def draw_side(ax, x, y, w, h, text, font_size=7.0):\n95:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n96:         (x, y), w, h,\n97:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n98:         linewidth=1.2,\n99:         edgecolor=\"#a855f7\",\n100:         facecolor=\"#f3e8ff\","}
