{"step_index":1667,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T23:30:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-25T18:30:52-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:30:55-05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-25T18:30:52-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:30:55-05:00\nShowing lines 120-443 of 443\n120:     %% Split off Swamped: Optional side cleanup vs. Mandatory Climax\n121:     M17 -.->|\"Optional Side Branch\"| M18[\"17. Don Gone<br/><code>COM_KBOS_CLEAN</code> • Clean Donnie's Trailer<br/>[ANY% SKIP / AUTO-FLAGGED]\"]\n122:     M18 -.-> M19[\"18. Recalibration<br/><code>HO_PAR_KEYCO</code> • Cal Grief Fishing<br/>[ANY% SKIP / AUTO-FLAGGED]\"]\n123:     \n124:     M17 ==>|\"Mandatory Story Spine\"| M20[\"19. Tourist Trap<br/><code>BIL_PICK</code> • Grassrivers Visitor Center<br/>[10:00–17:00 / 17:00–10:00]<br/>Dirty Cops Ambush — Jason Shot!\"]\n125:     M20 --> M21[\"20. Home Sweet Home<br/><code>BIL_HOUSE</code> • Lucia Solo Stash Retrieval<br/>Cartel Hitmen — House Burned Down!\"]\n126:     M21 --> M22[\"21. Discharge Time<br/><code>BIL_WHEEL</code> • VC Hospital Shootout<br/>★ CHAPTER 1 FINALE CLIMAX ★<br/>Ambulance Escape to Kelly County\"]\n127:     \n128:     M22 -->|\"Hard Transition\"| C2_Start[\"→ Chapter 2: What's in the Bag?<br/><code>MTL_WAKE</code> • Starlet Motel Arrival<br/>(func_10AA55 sweeps all 7 skipped side flags)\"]\n129: ```\n130: \n131: ---\n132: \n133: ## 3. Chapter 2: Paradise Lost (Port Gellhorn & Kelly County)\n134: \n135: ### Mechanics & Structure\n136: - **Playable Character**: Heavily centered on **Lucia** during early recovery, then **permanently unlocks Dual Character Switching** via *\"Coffee Break\"*.\n137: - **Vehicle Fencing**: Unlocked via *\"Moses\"* (enabling Slim Jim vehicle thefts and custom garage registrations).\n138: - **Strict Chronological Sequence**: Organized into **4 sequential stages** that must be cleared in order (M23 through M44).\n139:   - **Stage 1: Motel Arrival & Medical (M23–M28)**: Infiltration, paying upkeep, Lucia solo medical run, and establishing fencing with Moses.\n140:   - **Stage 2: Debt Hustle & Gun Runs (M29–M37)**: Disguise setups, ambulance chasing, painkiller supply lines, and corner meetups.\n141:   - **Stage 3: Dual Character Switching & Robberies (M38–M40)**: *Coffee Break* unlocks instant partner switching; *Hit Avery Pawn* introduces business robberies.\n142:   - **Stage 4: Highway Escape & Move to Vice City (M41–M44)**: Vehicle recovery, Kelly County smugglers, and the motel evacuation climax in *Checking Out*.\n143: \n144: ```mermaid\n145: flowchart TD\n146:     C1_Trans[\"From Ch. 1: Discharge Time [BIL_WHEEL]\"] --> S1_Start\n147:     \n148:     subgraph S1[\"Stage 1: Motel Arrival & Fencing (M23 - M28)\"]\n149:         S1_Start[\"23. What's in the Bag?<br/>(Starlet Motel Arrival)\"] --> M24[\"24. Overnight Charges\"]\n150:         M24 --> M25[\"25. Take Care of Jason<br/>(Lucia Solo Medical Run)\"]\n151:         M25 --> M26[\"26. Just Moved In\"]\n152:         M26 --> M27[\"27. Girls' Trip\"]\n153:         M27 --> M28[\"28. Moses<br/>(Vehicle Fencing Unlocked)\"]\n154:     end\n155:     \n156:     M28 -->|\"Stage 1 Complete\"| S2_Start\n157:     \n158:     subgraph S2[\"Stage 2: Debt Hustle & Gun Runs (M29 - M37)\"]\n159:         S2_Start[\"29. New Look -> 30. How Do I Look?\"] --> M31[\"31. Behind on Payments\"]\n160:         M31 --> M32[\"32. Ambulance Chaser\"]\n161:         M32 --> M33[\"33. Painkiller Supplier\"]\n162:         M33 --> M34[\"34. Daily Driver -> 35. Pick Up A Gun\"]\n163:         M34 --> M36[\"36. Slam Dunk -> 37. Breakfast Run\"]\n164:     end\n165:     \n166:     M36 -->|\"Stage 2 Complete\"| S3_Start\n167:     \n168:     subgraph S3[\"Stage 3: Dual Character Switching (M38 - M40)\"]\n169:         S3_Start[\"38. Coffee Break<br/>★ DUAL CHARACTER SWITCHING UNLOCKED ★\"] --> M39[\"39. Hit Avery Pawn<br/>(Robbery Mechanic Active)\"]\n170:         M39 --> M40[\"40. Hit Kingpin Bowling<br/>(Optional / Skip in Any%)\"]\n171:     end\n172:     \n173:     M40 -->|\"Stage 3 Complete\"| S4_Start\n174:     \n175:     subgraph S4[\"Stage 4: Highway Escape & Move to VC (M41 - M44)\"]\n176:         S4_Start[\"41. Impounded Vehicle\"] --> M42[\"42. Afternoon Delight\"]\n177:         M42 --> M43[\"43. Prepare for Vice City\"]\n178:         M43 --> M44[\"44. Checking Out<br/>★ CHAPTER 2 CLIMAX ★<br/>(Port Gellhorn Evacuation)\"]\n179:     end\n180:     \n181:     M44 -->|\"Hard Transition\"| C3_Start[\"→ Chapter 3: Welcome to Vice City\"]\n182: ```\n183: \n184: ---\n185: \n186: ## 4. Chapter 3: Vice City Syndicate Expansion & Bank Heist\n187: \n188: ### Mechanics & Structure\n189: - **Scope**: 26 main story operations (M45 through M70).\n190: - **Safehouse Spine (M45–M50)**: Infiltration into the metropolis culminates in *South Leonida Real Estate*, opening the primary Vice City safehouse.\n191: - **The 3 Parallel Alliance Strands**: Upon unlocking the safehouse, three major syndicate storylines open concurrently:\n192:   1. **Strand 1: Tyrone (Street Muscle)**: Missions 51 & 52 (*Tyrone* $\\rightarrow$ *Here, Kitty Kitty*).\n193:   2. **Strand 2: Boobie Ike & Dre'Quan (Syndicate)**: Missions 54, 55, & 56 (*Top Billing* $\\rightarrow$ *Boobie Time* $\\rightarrow$ *First Impressions*).\n194:   3. **Strand 3: Raul Bautista & Randy (Cartel Logistics & Cars)**: Missions 53, 57, 58, 59, & 60 (*Car Service* $\\rightarrow$ *Caught Slipping* $\\rightarrow$ *Crosstown Traffic* $\\rightarrow$ *Credit Check* $\\rightarrow$ *Steal Zorrusso for Randy*).\n195: - **Convergence at Heist Scope Out (M61)**: All 3 strands converge into *Sinfrontera National Bank*.\n196: - **The 3 Concurrent Heist Preparation Tracks**: Scope out unlocks the heist planning board, distributing prep work into 3 simultaneous tracks:\n197:   - **Track 1: Safecracker Pipeline**: *62. Security Expert* (Nicole Park) $\\rightarrow$ *65. Safe Word* (Drill) $\\rightarrow$ *68. Cooties* (Disinfection).\n198:   - **Track 2: Explosives Pipeline**: *63. Company Property* (Charges) $\\rightarrow$ *66. Hidden Charges* (Cell Towers) $\\rightarrow$ *69. Bricked Up* (Armor Route).\n199:   - **Track 3: Codes & Van Pipeline**: *64. The Missing Link* (Monty Interrogation) $\\rightarrow$ *67. Ride or Die* (Armored Van).\n200: - **The Heist Finale (M70)**: *The Cartel Heist* ($10.5M Take). \n201: - **CRITICAL SPEEDRUN REQUIREMENT**: Runners **MUST retain at least $75,000 cash** in their BuckMe account to clear Abe Gonzalez's mandatory wire gate in Chapter 4!\n202: \n203: ```mermaid\n204: flowchart TD\n205:     C2_Trans[\"From Ch. 2: Checking Out\"] --> M45[\"45. Welcome to Vice City\"]\n206:     M45 --> M46[\"46. Dealer's Choice\"]\n207:     M46 --> M47[\"47. Meet the Heders\"]\n208:     M47 --> M48[\"48. Dubious Provenance\"]\n209:     M48 --> M49[\"49. Mami Knows Best\"]\n210:     M49 --> M50[\"50. South Leonida Real Estate<br/>(Vice City Safehouse Unlocked)\"]\n211:     \n212:     M50 --> S1[\"Strand 1: Tyrone (Muscle)\"]\n213:     M50 --> S2[\"Strand 2: Boobie & Dre (Syndicate)\"]\n214:     M50 --> S3[\"Strand 3: Raul & Randy (Cartel & Cars)\"]\n215:     \n216:     subgraph Strands[\"3 Concurrent Faction Strands\"]\n217:         subgraph Strand_1[\"Strand 1\"]\n218:             S1[\"51. Tyrone\"] --> M52[\"52. Here, Kitty Kitty\"]\n219:         end\n220:         subgraph Strand_2[\"Strand 2\"]\n221:             S2[\"54. Top Billing\"] --> M55[\"55. Boobie Time\"]\n222:             M55 --> M56[\"56. First Impressions\"]\n223:         end\n224:         subgraph Strand_3[\"Strand 3\"]\n225:             S3[\"53. Car Service\"] --> M57[\"57. Caught Slipping\"]\n226:             M57 --> M58[\"58. Crosstown Traffic\"]\n227:             M58 --> M59[\"59. Credit Check\"]\n228:             M59 --> M60[\"60. Steal Zorrusso for Randy\"]\n229:         end\n230:     end\n231:     \n232:     M52 & M56 & M60 --> M61[\"61. Sinfrontera National Bank<br/>★ ALL 3 STRANDS CONVERGE HERE ★<br/>(Heist Scope Out & Board Unlocked)\"]\n233:     \n234:     subgraph Heist_Pipeline[\"Sinfrontera Bank Heist Prep (3 Concurrent Tracks)\"]\n235:         direction TB\n236:         subgraph T1[\"Track 1: Safecracker\"]\n237:             P62[\"62. Security Expert<br/>(Nicole Park)\"] --> P65[\"65. Safe Word<br/>(Safe-Cracking Drill)\"]\n238:             P65 --> P68[\"68. Cooties<br/>(Disinfection)\"]\n239:         end\n240:         subgraph T2[\"Track 2: Explosives\"]\n241:             P63[\"63. Company Property<br/>(Vault Charges)\"] --> P66[\"66. Hidden Charges<br/>(Rig 3 Towers)\"]\n242:             P66 --> P69[\"69. Bricked Up<br/>(Reinforce Route)\"]\n243:         end\n244:         subgraph T3[\"Track 3: Codes & Van\"]\n245:             P64[\"64. The Missing Link<br/>(Monty Interrogation)\"] --> P67[\"67. Ride or Die<br/>(Armored Van)\"]\n246:         end\n247:     end\n248:     \n249:     M61 ==>|\"Top Distribution Bus\"| P62\n250:     M61 ==>|\"Top Distribution Bus\"| P63\n251:     M61 ==>|\"Top Distribution Bus\"| P64\n252:     \n253:     P68 & P69 & P67 --> M70[\"70. THE CARTEL HEIST<br/>★ MAJOR HEIST CLIMAX ★<br/>($10.5M Vault Raid Take)<br/>⚠️ KEEP $75k FOR CHAPTER 4 ABE GATE ⚠️\"]\n254:     \n255:     M70 -->|\"Hard Transition\"| C4_Start[\"→ Chapter 4: Ocean Beach Safehouse\"]\n256: ```\n257: \n258: ---\n259: \n260: ## 5. Chapter 4: Vice City Metro & Airport Takedown\n261: \n262: ### Mechanics & Structure\n263: - **Scope**: 25 main missions (M71 through M95).\n264: - **Safehouse**: Y Hotel (Ocean Beach headquarters).\n265: - **Mandatory Cash Gate (M75)**: In *Party Hard*, corrupt lawyer Abe Gonzalez demands a mandatory **$75,000 BuckMe wire transfer** to proceed.\n266: - **Strict Chronological Sequence**:\n267:   - **Stage 1: Beachhead & Abe Gate (M71–M75)**: Establishing Ocean Beach lifestyle and securing legal immunity.\n268:   - **Stage 2: Syndicate Operations (M76–M82)**: Harbor smuggling, blackmail photography, fitness front extortion, and body sanitization.\n269:   - **Stage 3: Dre'Quan 